# MASTER PROJECT PROMPT: AQUACARE AI

## 1. PROJECT IDENTITY

Project Name: AquaCare AI

Full Title: AquaCare AI – Intelligent Vannamei Shrimp Farming Monitoring, AI Health Screening, Smart Farm Management and Harvest Prediction Ecosystem.

Project Type: Full-stack AI-powered aquaculture technology platform.

Target Users:
- Vannamei shrimp farmers.
- Aquaculture farm owners.
- Aquaculture consultants and experts.
- Laboratory professionals.
- Platform administrators.

Initial Target Region: West Godavari district, Andhra Pradesh, India.

Languages: English and Telugu.

Primary Goal:

Build a complete, intelligent, mobile-first aquaculture management ecosystem that helps vannamei shrimp farmers manage their entire farming lifecycle, from pond preparation and seed stocking to daily farm management, health monitoring, growth prediction, harvest planning and financial analysis.

This must be a real, functional software product, not just a static dashboard or UI prototype.

The platform should combine AI, machine learning, data analytics, farming calculations, predictive intelligence and a user-friendly interface.

